    hello again! Time really flies that fast.","parentUIDs":[],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":6,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":3}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":537,"yPos":262},"ID":2,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"So,
    what can I get you this time?","parentUIDs":[0],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":4}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":236,"yPos":362},"ID":3,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    wanna get some supplies before I go cyberdiving.","parentUIDs":[2],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":5}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":541,"yPos":363},"ID":4,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You
    are just in time! I just finished organizing the store.","parentUIDs":[3],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":6}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":230,"yPos":468},"ID":5,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
    first, I would like to show you some new arrivals!","parentUIDs":[4],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":7}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":539,"yPos":466},"ID":6,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"What
    I have here are the top of the market Augments! These babies really took a long
    time to get delivered here.","parentUIDs":[5],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":12,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":8}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":233,"yPos":588},"ID":7,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Cool.
    So how do these \"Augments\" work?","parentUIDs":[6],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":6,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":9}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":544,"yPos":567},"ID":8,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Augments
    are like consumable boosters, it can grant you some crazy effects when it gets
    activated!","parentUIDs":[7],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":8,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":10}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":228,"yPos":689},"ID":9,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"BUT!
    Using multiple Augments all at once can make the user cybernetically unstable,
    then eventually their minds go kaboom!","parentUIDs":[8],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":14,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":11}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":529,"yPos":682},"ID":10,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    can only administer 1 Augment per customer as stated by the law, or else my shop
    would be terminated.","parentUIDs":[9],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":12,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":231,"yPos":787},"ID":11,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Basically,
    this is just steroids for cybermen?","parentUIDs":[10],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":13}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":526,"yPos":793},"ID":12,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"In
    a sense, yeah!","parentUIDs":[11],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":3,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":37}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":220,"yPos":895},"ID":13,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wolf,
    I think this is the one we''ve looking for. Here, use our extra Frags.","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":8,"Volume":0.8},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":15}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":525,"yPos":1013},"ID":14,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"So
    what do you think? Would you like to purchase one?","parentUIDs":[37],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":4,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":17}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":227,"yPos":1015},"ID":15,"ParamActions":[{"__type":"EditableSetIntParamAction:#DialogueEditor","ParameterName":"playerMoney","Value":1000}],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"These
    Augments are really something else, let me think about this first...","parentUIDs":[14],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":373.5,"yPos":1198},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I''ll
    just have these items, but no Augments.","parentUIDs":[17],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":5,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":611.5,"yPos":1202},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Cocky
    today aren''t we? I hope that pride of yours wont fail you!","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":true,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":7,"Volume":0.8},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":39}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":614.5,"yPos":1314},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Alright!
